{"seq":26,"slug":"open-source-maintainership","title":"开源项目维护","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 开源项目维护\n\n写出一个开源项目只是起点，把它维护下去才是真正的难题。这个 hub 站在维护者的位置上看世界：当一段代码被发布到公共仓库、有了第一个外部贡献者、收到第一个愤怒的议题、被某家公司放进生产环境之后，原本的作者就悄悄换了一种身份。他不再只是写代码的人，而是要在法律、社区、工程、资金、心理这五条战线上同时作战的角色。本 hub 要回答的，正是这个角色每天面对的真实问题。\n\n它和兄弟 hub 的分工很清楚。开发者关系（DevRel）关心的是如何让外部开发者用上、用好一个产品，视角朝外；技术文档关心的是如何把知识准确地写给读者，视角朝下游。而开源项目维护的视角朝内、朝上游：它关心的是项目本身如何被治理、被发布、被守护、被传承。同一件事，比如一份 README，在文档 hub 里是写作问题，在这里则是「它能不能把一个陌生人变成第二个维护者」的治理问题。\n\n四条主线层层递进。第一条是[开源维护基础](1_foundations/_INTRODUCTION.md)，先把维护者这个角色、它脚下的许可证与治理地基、以及项目从诞生到归档的完整生命周期讲清楚——没有这层认知，后面所有动作都是无根的。第二条是[社区与协作](2_community/_INTRODUCTION.md)，因为开源的核心资产从来不是代码而是人：如何把路人引导成贡献者、如何在评审里既守住质量又不赶走新人、如何在冲突中保住社区。第三条是[工程与发布](3_engineering/_INTRODUCTION.md)，这是维护者每天动手的部分：分诊堆积如山的议题、用版本号向下游传递契约、在漏洞披露的钟声响起时守住供应链。第四条是[可持续与文化](4_practice/_INTRODUCTION.md)，回到最根本也最常被忽视的问题——钱从哪来、人会不会累垮、项目能不能在创始人离开后活下去，以及哪些看似勤勉的习惯其实正在杀死项目。\n\n把这四条线连起来，你会看到一个维护者真实的一天：早上分诊议题，中午评审 PR 时安抚一位被拒绝的贡献者，下午处理一封安全披露邮件，晚上一边怀疑自己为什么还在无偿做这件事，一边给基金会写资助申请。本 hub 不提供「正确答案」，因为开源维护几乎没有正确答案，只有权衡。它提供的是把这些权衡看清楚的框架，以及无数前人踩过的坑。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"开源维护基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-maintainership","title":"什么是开源维护者","url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/foundations/what-is-maintainership"},{"seq":2,"slug":"licenses-governance","title":"许可证与治理模型","url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/foundations/licenses-governance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"project-lifecycle","title":"项目生命周期与可持续性","url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/foundations/project-lifecycle"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"community","title":"社区与协作","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/community","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"contributor-onboarding","title":"贡献者引导与成长","url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/community/contributor-onboarding"},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-review-pr","title":"代码评审与 PR 流程","url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/community/code-review-pr"},{"seq":3,"slug":"communication-conflict","title":"沟通、行为准则与冲突","url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/community/communication-conflict"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程与发布","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"issue-triage","title":"议题分诊与积压管理","url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/engineering/issue-triage"},{"seq":2,"slug":"versioning-releases","title":"版本管理与发布","url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/engineering/versioning-releases"},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-supply-chain","title":"安全响应与供应链","url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/engineering/security-supply-chain"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"可持续与文化","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"funding-sustainability","title":"资金与可持续性","url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/practice/funding-sustainability"},{"seq":2,"slug":"burnout-delegation","title":"倦怠、委派与继任","url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/practice/burnout-delegation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"maintainer-antipatterns","title":"常见反模式与权衡","url":"/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/practice/maintainer-antipatterns"}]}]}